  "description": "Operating Area: Italy, Amalfi Coast, Sardinia, Pontine Islands, Tuscany, Sicily & Aeolian Islands, Liguria & Cinque Terre\n\nSBK is a 2024 Azimut 68 Fly designed to elevate every moment at sea. With her dynamic lines, advanced technology, and luxurious interiors, she embodies the very best of Italian yacht design.\n\nSBK offers accommodation for up to 8 guests in 4 stylish cabins, including 1 Master suite, 1 VIP Stateroom, 2 Twin cabins. Her interiors, curated by acclaimed designer Achille Salvagni, are bathed in natural light through wide glazed windows, creating an inviting and sophisticated atmosphere. Clean lines, soft tones, and refined details define a space that is both contemporary and welcoming.\n\nHer exterior, penned by Alberto Mancini, reflects the timeless elegance of Azimut, blending sportiness with grace. SBK’s generous outdoor areas include a large flybridge with sunbathing and dining zones, a versatile bow lounge that can transform from sofa to sunbed, and an aft cockpit perfect for relaxed gatherings.\n\nShe reaches speeds of up to 32 knots, while her Carbon Tech construction ensures stability, efficiency, and a smooth ride. Guests can enjoy both exhilarating cruising and serene anchorages with equal ease. From sunlit mornings on the flybridge to sunset cocktails at anchor, SBK delivers the perfect setting for unforgettable experiences. She is not just a yacht to charter, but a lifestyle to embrace - whether for a fun-filled family holiday, an adventure with friends, or a serene getaway for two.",
